  "_pinned": [
    "The produced-dialect list. No dialect spelling is objectively right, so",
    "ours becomes the course's orthography and the gate enforces exactly one.",
    "",
    "MATCHED ON EXACT SPELLING, not folded: the umlaut IS the difference, and",
    "folding once made the gate reject Gruezi-with-an-umlaut as a misspelling",
    "of itself. Single words are matched as words; anything with a space is",
    "matched as a phrase in the line."
  ],
